              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wakaha Bena Gada ne Bena Lubena ne tshituha tshia tshisamba tshia Manashe muana mulume wa Yosefe buloba bua Sihona, mukelenge wa Bena Amole ne buloba bua Oga mukelenge wa Bashana, bungi bua misoko yabo to ne ku matshika abo onso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
